(   [Problem Statement]: Analyze word-formation processes in biotechnology: derivation, compounding, blending, and acronymy.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Morphological Evolution of Scientific Lexis:) Tj
T*
