T*
(   meanings, which must be converted into formal Latinate terminology in academic publications:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Taxonomic Conversion:) Tj
T*
(   - Break down:) Tj
T*
(   - Meaning: Chemical decomposition or enzymatic digestion.) Tj
T*
(   - Formal Replacement: Degrade, decompose, catabolize, lyse, hydrolyze.) Tj
T*
(   - Example: "Proteases hydrolyze polypeptide chains.") Tj
T*
(   - Break out:) Tj
T*
