T*
(   - Formal Replacement: Erupt, emerge, manifest.) Tj
T*
(   - Example: "A nosocomial outbreak of MRSA emerged in the intensive care ward.") Tj
T*
(   - Break through:) Tj
T*
(   - Meaning: Overcoming a major technological barrier.) Tj
T*
(   - Formal Replacement: Achieve a milestone, innovate, overcome.) Tj
T*
(   - Break up:) Tj
T*
(   - Meaning: Physical fragmentation of aggregates.) Tj
T*
(   - Formal Replacement: Disperse, disaggregate, fragment, homogenize.) Tj
T*
(   - Example: "Ultrasonic sonication was applied to disperse protein aggregates.") Tj
T*
() Tj
