(   - Example: "Thermal runaway activated the automated fire suppression system.") Tj
T*
(   - Set back:) Tj
T*
(   - Meaning: Delaying experimental timelines.) Tj
T*
(   - Formal Replacement: Impeded, delayed, hindered.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
