BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Examine confusing words: 'Eradicate', 'Eliminate', 'Ablate', and 'Extirpate' in cellular and genetic targeting.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Precise Lexical Selection in Targeted Therapeutics:) Tj
T*
(   While all four verbs denote removal or destruction, biomedical research demands precise) Tj
T*
(   mechanistic distinction:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Fine Semantic Boundaries:) Tj
T*
(   - Eradicate:) Tj
T*
(   - Applied to infectious diseases or total populations of pathogens; complete worldwide) Tj
T*
(   destruction:) Tj
T*
(   - "Smallpox was successfully eradicated through global vaccination campaigns.") Tj
T*
(   - "The antibiotic regimen eradicated the Helicobacter pylori infection.") Tj
T*
(   - Eliminate:) Tj
T*
(   - General removal or exclusion of a specific variable, contaminant, or cell subset:) Tj
T*
(   - "Pre-filtering the sample eliminated particulate interference.") Tj
T*
(   - Ablate:) Tj
T*
(   - Surgical, physical, or genetic destruction of a specific anatomical tissue, organ, or gene) Tj
T*
(   locus:) Tj
T*
(   - "Laser ablation was utilized to target focal tumor margins.") Tj
T*
(   - "Genetic ablation of the TP53 locus induced spontaneous oncogenesis.") Tj
T*
(   - Extirpate:) Tj
T*
(   - Complete physical excision of an organ or total localized extermination of a species.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F2 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(>> Solution to Question 20:) Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Analyze transitional discourse markers and signposting vocabulary in peer-reviewed scientific arguments.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. The Rhetorical Architecture of Scientific Signposting:) Tj
T*
(   Academic writing is not merely a catalogue of facts; it is a logically reasoned persuasive) Tj
T*
(   argument. Transitional discourse markers guide the reader through complex evidentiary chains:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Strategic Categorization of Discourse Markers:) Tj
T*
(   - Additive / Reinforcing Markers:) Tj
T*
(   - Furthermore, Moreover, In addition, Additionally.) Tj
T*
(   - Function: Introduces independent complementary evidence strengthening a claim.) Tj
T*
(   - Adversative / Contrastive Markers:) Tj
T*
(   - However, Conversely, In contrast, On the contrary, Notwithstanding, Whereas.) Tj
T*
(   - Function: Signals an unexpected divergence, counter-evidence, or theoretical limitation.) Tj
T*
(   - Causal / Consequential Markers:) Tj
T*
ET

